flowchart TD
  A(START)--> B[story-implement or story-implement-tasks]
  B --> C[story-code-review]
  C --> E{verdict}
  E -->|NEEDS-CHANGES| B
  E -->|APPROVED| H[story-verify]
  H --> I{verdict}
  I -->|NEEDS-CHANGES| B
  I -->|APPROVED| J[story-acceptance]
  J--> K{verdict}
  K -->|NEEDS-CHANGES| B
  K -->|APPROVED| L(END)

